ThemeExtras reads library banners from this folder, keyed by library SourceName
(e.g. "Steam.png", "GOG.png"), per BannersBySourceNamePath in themeExtras.yaml.

Shipped empty on purpose: themeExtras.yaml already declared the path while the folder
did not exist. Images/Banners is listed under PersistentPaths, so anything you drop
here survives theme updates - unlike the rest of the theme directory, which Playnite
wipes on every install.
